Package: decisions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Title: Typed Decisions from Decision Models
Description: Calls decision models, which return a probability for each
    allowed answer to a typed question. Provides typed questions, deciders
    for several providers, and tools to save, score and evaluate a setup.
    Includes injury reports from the Severe Injury Reports of the U.S.
    Occupational Safety and Health Administration
    <https://www.osha.gov/severe-injury-reports>, food recall reports of the
    U.S. Food and Drug Administration
    <https://open.fda.gov/apis/food/enforcement/>, and simulated textile images
    made with 'spc4sts' (Bui and Apley, 2021) <doi:10.1080/00224065.2019.1707730>.
